      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change appears to combine several independent pieces of work that I think would benefit from being split into separate commits. Keeping commits focused on a single logical change makes them easier to review, bisect, and revert when needed.\n\nThe SBI TAPI topology listener is grouped together with the inter-domain link builder utilities and inter-domain link handling changes, even though those can be reviewed independently.\n\nAs a proposed way forward, I’ve split this into focused commits without changing the implementation. The original authorship has been preserved; I only reorganized the changes into separate commits:\n\n- tapi: add inter-domain link builder and ID utils https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123800\n- Fix inter-domain link handling https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123801\n- Add SBI TAPI topology listener https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123802\n\nI’m happy to discuss this further so we can converge on a common approach for structuring changes going forward.",
